BudgetFigures.description:
The budget arithmetic for the running month. `DailyAverage` = spent / elapsed days (today included);
`ProjectedMonthEnd` = spent × days in month / elapsed days (string BudgetCheckService.ProjectionMethod),
computed from the exact ratio, not the rounded average. All amounts are rounded to two decimals, away from zero.

CurrencySavings.description:
One currency's simulation. `MonthlyAverage` = `TotalSpent` / months, months without spending included;
the savings are computed from the exact total, not from the rounded average. `MonthlyAmounts` is the evidence:
every complete month used, in order.
